From c573ef3d3b917924625ddf64138547c92e8d7e9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nyasha <nmushambi@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 11:14:35 +1300
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: jdi-lpm089a128a: set the VGH/VGL charge-pump
 dividers (MCS 0xD0)

Dark content made the backlight pulse: the TCON's charge-pump noise couples
into the panel's backlight controller. Program VGH /3.3 and VGL /4.1, the
values panel-jdi-lpm102a188a uses for the same JDI/Renesas family. Verified
live on hardware through the debugfs cmd file: dark screens steady. A
separate content-dependent flicker on colourful screens is also present
under the stock kernel (TWRP), so it is a property of the panel.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-jdi-lpm089a128a.c | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-jdi-lpm089a128a.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-jdi-lpm089a128a.c
index 2fa51db24..d3e73a383 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-jdi-lpm089a128a.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-jdi-lpm089a128a.c
@@ -239,6 +239,14 @@ static int jdi_panel_prepare(struct drm_panel *panel)
 	mipi_dsi_dual_generic_write_seq_multi(&dsi_ctx, jdi->link1, jdi->link2,
 					      JDI_MCS_CTRL,
 					      JDI_MCS_CTRL_ENABLE);
+	/*
+	 * Move the TCON charge-pump noise away from the backlight controller:
+	 * VGH divide 3.3, VGL divide 4.1 (MCS 0xD0), as panel-jdi-lpm102a188a
+	 * does for the same JDI/Renesas family. Without it dark content makes
+	 * the backlight pulse; verified live on the panel (2026-10-25).
+	 */
+	mipi_dsi_dual_generic_write_seq_multi(&dsi_ctx, jdi->link1, jdi->link2,
+					      0xd0, 0x42, 0x95);
 	mipi_dsi_dual_generic_write_seq_multi(&dsi_ctx, jdi->link1, jdi->link2,
 					      JDI_MCS_PAGE_SELECT,
 					      JDI_MCS_PAGE_DISPLAY);
-- 
